          "endLine": 219,
          "code": "      <section class=\"lesson\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Database mental model</p>\n        <h2>What each stored row looks like</h2>\n        <div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Table</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Important columns</th><th>Who may access it</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n          <tr><td><code>auth.users</code></td><td>Supabase-managed account identity.</td><td><code>id</code>, <code>email</code>, user metadata, app metadata</td><td>Managed by Supabase Auth; admin SQL can assign app role.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>profiles</code></td><td>Display name and email usable in public-table relationships.</td><td><code>id</code>, <code>full_name</code>, <code>email</code></td><td>Employee reads own; admin reads all.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>logs</code></td><td>One complete work session per row; an open row has a null Time Out.</td><td><code>user_id</code>, <code>shift_date</code>, <code>time_in</code>, <code>time_out</code></td><td>Employee manages own; admin reads through the reporting view.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>admin_work_logs</code></td><td>Search-friendly reporting view that combines a log with employee identity.</td><td>log fields, <code>full_name</code>, <code>email</code>, <code>search_text</code></td><td>Admin SELECT access, backed by the underlying tables and policies.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>shifts</code></td><td>Normal recurring Monday–Sunday work pattern.</td><td><code>user_id</code>, <code>day_of_week</code>, start/end time, <code>is_overnight</code></td><td>Employee reads own; admin manages all.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>shift_overrides</code></td><td>Exception for one exact calendar date.</td><td><code>shift_date</code>, custom times, <code>is_overnight</code>, <code>is_day_off</code>, notes</td><td>Employee reads own; admin manages all.</td></tr>\n          <tr><td><code>email_reminders</code></td><td>Recurring email schedule and delivery result.</td><td>days, time, timezone, content, status, last sent date</td><td>Admins through RLS; Edge Function through service role.</td></tr>\n        </tbody></table></div>\n        <h3>Example related data</h3>",
