          "code": "      <section class=\"lesson\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Complete user journeys</p>\n        <h2>See how modules cooperate before studying them separately</h2>\n        <div class=\"journey-grid\">\n          <article><h3>Employee Time In</h3><ol><li>App restores the session.</li><li>Home loads the employee’s <code>logs</code>.</li><li>Home finds a row whose <code>time_out</code> is null.</li><li>TimeButtons calls Home’s <code>timeIn</code>.</li><li>Home inserts one open <code>logs</code> row.</li><li>React prepends it and changes the button to Time Out.</li></ol></article>\n          <article><h3>Admin views and exports</h3><ol><li>App verifies admin app metadata.</li><li>Admin requests one page from <code>admin_work_logs</code>.</li><li>Postgres applies search and returns an exact count.</li><li>Previous/Next changes <code>page</code> and reruns that query.</li><li>Refresh changes <code>refreshNumber</code> and reruns it without changing the page.</li><li>Export performs its own batched query so the CSV is not limited to the visible page.</li></ol></article>\n          <article><h3>Recurring email</h3><ol><li>Admin inserts an active reminder.</li><li>Cron POSTs to the Edge Function.</li><li>The worker checks weekday and local time.</li><li>It claims the row using <code>last_sent_on</code>.</li><li>Brevo receives the email request.</li><li>Success or failure is saved for inspection/retry.</li></ol></article>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n",
