          "code": "      <section class=\"lesson module-section\" id=\"startup\">\n        <div class=\"module-heading\"><span class=\"card-number\">1</span><div><h2>Startup, Supabase client, and routing</h2><p>Starts React, creates one database client, restores authentication, and chooses the page.</p></div></div>\n        <ul class=\"file-list\"><li><code>index.html</code></li><li><code>package.json</code></li><li><code>vite.config.js</code></li><li><code>eslint.config.js</code></li><li><code>vercel.json</code></li><li><code>src/main.jsx</code></li><li><code>src/lib/supabase.js</code></li><li><code>src/App.jsx</code></li></ul>\n        <div class=\"module-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Startup views\">\n          <button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-panel=\"startup-overall\">Overall</button>\n          <button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-panel=\"startup-code\">Code chunks</button>\n          <button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-panel=\"startup-logic\">Logical explanation</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"module-panel\" id=\"startup-overall\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n          <p><code>index.html</code> provides the browser root. <code>package.json</code>, Vite, ESLint, and Vercel configuration define commands, compilation, checks, and direct-URL routing. <code>main.jsx</code> attaches React to <code>root</code>. <code>supabase.js</code> creates the shared client from Vite environment variables. <code>App.jsx</code> restores the session, listens for future login/logout events, and protects routes.</p>\n          <div class=\"flow\"><div>index.html #root</div><div>main.jsx</div><div>App.jsx</div><div>Supabase session</div><div>Chosen route</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"module-panel\" id=\"startup-code\" role=\"tabpanel\" hidden>\n          <h3>Mount the root component</h3>",
