          "code": "      <section class=\"lesson module-section\" id=\"adminlogs\">\n        <div class=\"module-heading\"><span class=\"card-number\">6</span><div><h2>Administrator logs, search, pagination, and CSV export</h2><p>Lets Postgres search and paginate the table while a separate batched query prepares the complete export.</p></div></div>\n        <ul class=\"file-list\"><li><code>src/pages/Admin.jsx</code></li><li><code>src/components/admin/WorkLogsPanel.jsx</code></li><li><code>src/components/admin/AdminTabs.jsx</code></li><li><code>src/lib/adminLogHelpers.js</code></li></ul>\n        <div class=\"module-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Admin log views\"><button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-panel=\"admin-overall\">Overall</button><button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-panel=\"admin-code\">Code chunks</button><button class=\"module-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-panel=\"admin-logic\">Logical explanation</button></div>\n        <div class=\"module-panel\" id=\"admin-overall\" role=\"tabpanel\"><p>The table requests only 20 rows at a time from <code>admin_work_logs</code>. A 400 ms debounce waits until typing pauses before changing <code>debouncedSearch</code>. Because <code>page</code>, <code>debouncedSearch</code>, and <code>refreshNumber</code> are effect dependencies, changing any of them reruns the table query. Export is deliberately separate: it retrieves every matching row in batches of 1,000 so the downloaded CSV is complete even though the screen shows one page.</p></div>\n        <div class=\"module-panel\" id=\"admin-code\" role=\"tabpanel\" hidden>\n          <h3>Debounce typing</h3><div class=\"code-wrap\"><pre><code>useEffect(() =&gt; {\n  const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; {\n    setDebouncedSearch(search.trim())\n    setPage(1)\n  }, 400)\n",
