          "code": "          <p>\n            React controls the browser interface. Supabase provides authentication\n            and the database. Row Level Security decides which database rows the\n            signed-in user may read or change.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            The current design stores one whole work session in one <code>logs</code>\n            row. Time In inserts it with a null <code>time_out</code>; Time Out updates\n            that same row. The row can therefore show both times, shift date,\n            duration, and status together.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n",
